<title>USA: West Harris Cty, Texas, district deal postponed.</title>
<headline>West Harris Cty, Texas, district deal postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Harris County Municipal Utility District No 10, Texas, postponed a $3.97 million general obligation bond issue, originally set for competitive sale Thursday, until Nov 18, the district's financial adviser said Thursday.</p>
<p>GMS Group said the deal was postponed because of a mistake in the preliminary official statement.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
